  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Stir grape soft drink mix, orange soft drink mix, sugar, and water together until sugar is dissolved. Stir in chilled ginger ale just before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "For an optional frozen hand, fill a food-safe disposable glove with water, secure with a rubber band, and freeze until solid. Dip the frozen hand briefly in warm water, remove and discard the glove, and float the frozen hand in the punch bowl for a spooky effect.",
